        ],
        "text_sha256": "732277eb372452254f040fa8d30a6fe1186bb92a384c831aa3f5d0b506b7e949"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n新政治大案、酷吏脸谱、全家一日变赤贫、权贵救场、作者评叹。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
