          25779
        ],
        "text_sha256": "d19c0f3d8108cb247e7d1056b399a022f07db43deda2c883507ad32b6eb40d89"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n整回必须按“程序逐步收紧”重排，是压力测试核心。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
